    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.files\n\n### Description\n\nHi!\r\nThis is less of a feature request and more of an inquiry.\r\n\r\nThe help page is very clear on git integration being out of scope, however it does hint that it's achievable by setting extmarks on the `MiniFilesBufferUpdate` event.\r\n\r\nI hope some code snippet of this gets added to the wiki or the examples section in the help file.",
