        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nThe problem here is actually computing status of each path, adding extmarks would be somewhat straightforward (needs only the proper combination of options). In turn, getting information about Git status for every path and in a way that is at least somewhat efficient (at least non-blocking and not loading 100% CPU) is not something that can be expressed in a concise and usable manner. So I don't think it will be added.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.\r\n\r\n------\r\n\r\n(There is planned 'mini.git' module for which I already have approximate scope and I also don't really see a concise way of utilizing it for this kind of task).",
